    <string name="edge_accessibility_label">z2term Android actions</string>
    <string name="edge_accessibility_description">Performs Android actions requested by commands, macros or gestures, using window bounds, focus and package metadata. Explicit UI-element requests also read visible text, descriptions and resource IDs, excluding editable and password nodes. While automatic-colour bars are visible, periodically captures screen images to sample nearby brightness. Images are not saved or sent and are released after sampling.</string>
    <string name="edge_accessibility_help">This action requires Accessibility, a separate permission from display over other apps. Use z2-key permission to enable z2term Android actions. If restricted, use z2-key app-info and allow restricted settings in its menu.</string>
