    <string name="edge_section_gestures">Gestures</string>
    <string name="edge_gestures_help">Add actions to each gesture and arrange their execution order. Remove all actions to leave a gesture unassigned. Hold to edit or move. Swipes can start auto-scroll with speed set by displacement. Tap anywhere on the screen to stop scrolling. Maximum speed is 40,000 dp/s; assign speed changes and reversal to swipes. Screen taps may also reach the app underneath. Target coordinates are percentages within the focused window. Android actions require Accessibility.</string>
